{"4422660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BLOODMOORED", "steam_appid": 4422660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOODMOORED</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where you play as a young woman trying to escape an abandoned industrial complex. Explore dark, decaying workshops, solve puzzles, and operate machinery to progress further. But be careful — you are not alone here. The ghosts of the past don’t just frighten you; they stalk you, interfere with you, and are ready to kill. To survive, you’ll have to uncover their story… and set them free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/61a3d089103baddb04b065b76be7b531.poster.avif?t=1779457850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/61a3d089103baddb04b065b76be7b531.webm?t=1779457850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/61a3d089103baddb04b065b76be7b531.mp4?t=1779457850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> explore the facility, operate machinery, gather clues, and solve a variety of puzzles—physical, logical, and environmental. Avoid hostile entities, outsmart them, and discover new ways to progress. You’re not just solving puzzles — you’re adapting to constantly changing rules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/12b49e7a7b4b494c06319265af6ec9e2.poster.avif?t=1779457850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/12b49e7a7b4b494c06319265af6ec9e2.webm?t=1779457850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/12b49e7a7b4b494c06319265af6ec9e2.mp4?t=1779457850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong>  Anna inherits her father’s old factory—along with its dark past. Uncover the horrors that took place within these walls, how this place is connected to you, and why you may be the one who can bring it all to an end. This is a story about guilt, cruelty, and consequences that linger long after death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/763dade5372409b1c93c7cafbbf763b1.poster.avif?t=1779457850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/763dade5372409b1c93c7cafbbf763b1.webm?t=1779457850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/763dade5372409b1c93c7cafbbf763b1.mp4?t=1779457850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong> trapped between life and death, the spirits are lost in their memories—shifting between rage and desperation. One moment they hunt you; the next, they may become the key to your survival. Each ghost has its own story and unique behavior. Who they were in life may guide you in how to deal with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/b3eb567eabaf2079969e7ae5e08dd512.poster.avif?t=1779457850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/b3eb567eabaf2079969e7ae5e08dd512.webm?t=1779457850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/b3eb567eabaf2079969e7ae5e08dd512.mp4?t=1779457850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Evolving gameplay mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A wide range of puzzles: physical, logical, and spatial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unique enemies with their own backstories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Exploration of a large, interconnected environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Atmospheric cutscenes and a dramatic narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Interactive environments</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOODMOORED</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where you play as a young woman trying to escape an abandoned industrial complex. Explore dark, decaying workshops, solve puzzles, and operate machinery to progress further. But be careful — you are not alone here. The ghosts of the past don’t just frighten you; they stalk you, interfere with you, and are ready to kill. To survive, you’ll have to uncover their story… and set them free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/61a3d089103baddb04b065b76be7b531.poster.avif?t=1779457850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4422660/extras/61a3d089103baddb04b065b76be7b531.webm?t=1779457850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co